CGwF rules engine (engine/)

This module links against and runs the Forge rules engine
(https://github.com/Card-Forge/forge), copyright the Forge authors, licensed
under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later. Because it links forge-game,
this module is itself distributed under the GNU General Public License v3.0
(see LICENSE). The pinned Forge release is recorded in pom.xml (forge.version)
and Dockerfile (FORGE_TAG); Forge is fetched at build time and is not vendored.

Card scripts, set data and format lists under forge-gui/res are Forge's and are
copied into the container image unchanged.

